config BATTERY_SAVER
	tristate "Adaptive SDM845 Battery Saver and Power Optimization Module"
	depends on CPU_FREQ && HOTPLUG_CPU
	default m
	help
	  This module provides adaptive battery saving and thermal power
	  optimization for Qualcomm Snapdragon 845 (Xiaomi Poco F1 'beryllium').

	  It clamps peak CPU frequencies on both Little (Silver) and Big (Gold)
	  clusters, regulates Big cluster active core counts, and provides multiple
	  power profiles (Balanced, Extreme, Ultra, Custom).

	  When unloaded (rmmod), it automatically and completely restores original
	  hardware frequency limits and core states.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called battery_saver.
